  ('46be95ca-4d35-49af-af9b-7b726954b606', 'A', 'reversed_relationship', 'Silencing the antagonist''s own motor neuron would slacken it, the opposite of the observed sustained contraction'),
  ('46be95ca-4d35-49af-af9b-7b726954b606', 'B', 'partial_truth', 'Biceps efferent is a real reflex-arc neuron but drives the flexor contraction that stayed normal'),
